    "text": "A data consists of <math><mi>n</mi></math> observations: <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the variance of this data is",
